{"overview":"کییچی مئابارا، تازه‌وارد به روستای آرام هینامیزاوا، در حال آشنایی سریع با دختران مدرسه‌اش است و به موقع برای جشن بزرگ سالانه می‌رسد. اما چیزی در این شهر منزوی «ناراحت‌کننده» به نظر می‌رسد و حس ترس او روز به روز بیشتر می‌شود. با این اضطراب که شاید درست باشد، این جامعه کوچک چه رازهای تاریکی را در دل دارد؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"New kid Keiichi Maebara is settling into his new home of peaceful Hinamizawa village. Making quick friends with the girls from his school, he's arrived in time for the big festival of the year. But something about this isolated town seems \"off,\" and his feelings of dread continue to grow. With a gnawing fear that he's right, what dark secrets could this small community be hiding?","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2020,"poster":"/y3qtY32e0sTOV6wyCIuz8eRolro.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":15,"y":2021,"poster":"/jY9wWW68UrZjFNEDrmWb5knoBei.jpg"}],"episodes":39,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"保志総一朗","role":"Keiichi Maebara (voice)","photo":"/kBULhALfWrkacAuX9KZHBx27nfJ.jpg","en":"Soichiro Hoshi"},{"name":"مای ناکاهارا","role":"Rena Ryuuguu (voice)","photo":"/s8DBmM540SRlRzUplaapMaDo8vV.jpg","en":"Mai Nakahara"},{"name":"ゆきのさつき","role":"Mion Sonozaki / Shion Sonozaki (voice)","photo":"/fb9LqdOZPNjlXq3uHriBOmIe2WP.jpg","en":"Satsuki Yukino"},{"name":"かないみか","role":"Satoko Houjou (voice)","photo":"/xgzMllu0fNQua9iBJBJnILX9eFK.jpg","en":"Mika Kanai"},{"name":"田村ゆかり","role":"Rika Furude (voice)","photo":"/AigHQPetpcKee62ekHsYFSpQeWE.jpg","en":"Yukari Tamura"},{"name":"茶風林","role":"Kuraudo Ooishi (voice)","photo":"/kiPG7EtYWxkj78US35gnTIMq5Dn.jpg","en":"Chafurin"},{"name":"大川透","role":"Jirou Tomitake (voice)","photo":"/dkVP18qK730qbki25nogZzBbfuM.jpg","en":"Toru Okawa"},{"name":"伊藤美紀","role":"Miyo Takano (voice)","photo":"/6osSzjWq1MZ0XznG3UZHpB81lJF.jpg","en":"Miki Ito"},{"name":"関俊彦","role":"Kyousuke Irie (voice)","photo":"/7jUPvx4hxWZWZJgyiCwd8K